# Synapmsg north star

Follow root `.cursorrules`, `SYNAPMSG_NORTE.md`, and `docs/comparativa-synapmsg-norte.pdf`.

- Brand teal `#30B0B0`; mobile colors from `apps/mobile/src/theme/colors.ts`.
